# Your rule content

- The system should use cabal to build
- we are trying to move from makefiles to cabal as a build system
- we are also trying to modernize the bluespec project to use modern haskell
- do not alter the bs and bsv files, if the compiler can't compile them it's doing something wrong
- do not ever try to build anything using a makefile, cabal should be the only building tool.
- the design should be portable, arm64, x86_64, riscv
- all libraries should be shared
- we are initially building for arm64
- don't use Yices/Z3/STP directly use them through SBV




